      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidizing exposure produces a dual-layer oxide structure in the target alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::018::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The outer part of the proposed dual-layer structure is a protective oxide.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An elemental-depletion zone lies beneath the outer oxide layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localized grain-boundary compositional changes govern early-stage degradation while the bulk fcc matrix remains intact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing exposure suppresses oxidation relative to oxidizing exposure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing oxidation prevents localized Cr and Al depletion and preserves a uniform grain-boundary composition.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing exposure produces minimal oxide scale formation and preserves the alloy's mechanical properties.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
